\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Per-target resistance-resilience scores (RRS, \Cref  {eq:rrs}) for the 17-member cohort. Values are percentages of the corresponding wild-type Vina score magnitude; \textemdash {} marks wild-type non-binders ($|S_{\mathrm  {Vina},i,WT,t}|<\qty {5}{\kilo \calorie \per \mole }$), excluded from the denominator. RRS$_{\mathrm  {mean}}$ is the candidate mean over all eligible target--mutant ratios. Classes are the operational categories defined in \Cref  {SM-tab:rrs_classes}, not biological resistance phenotypes.}}{10}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
